        `<a href="https://unstats.un.org/unsd/demographic-social/crvs/" target="_blank">United Nations Statistics Division, 2023, Quality of vital statistics obtained from civil registration page on the United Nations Demographic Yearbook Vital Statistics Questionnaire.</a> Extracted: 15 May 2024`;

